WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
No photo.
Just a question.

00:01.500 --> 00:03.500
What's a theory about the world
you've never told anyone?

00:03.500 --> 00:06.000
"That the best conversations always happen
when you least expect them."

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
wait. you also take the long way home
just to finish a thought?

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
I think our minds just completely clicked.
Wants to reveal.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.750
Kabir.
This is what he looks like.

00:12.750 --> 00:15.000
Meet minds first.
Join Wave 1 · whispr.in
